#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Dtc"
msgstr "Instalação de Dtc"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>dtc</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>dtc</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:85
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release  \\\n"
"            -Dpython=disabled .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release  \\\n"
"            -Dpython=disabled .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#.  https://github.com/dgibson/dtc/commit/32174a66efa4
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>meson test -v</command>.  Two tests "
"named <filename>cell-overflow.dts</filename> and <filename>cell-overflow-"
"results.dts</filename> are known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>meson test -v</command>. Dois "
"testes chamados <filename>cell-overflow.dts</filename> e <filename>cell-"
"overflow-results.dts</filename> são conhecidos por falharem."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:104
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid "Still as the &root; user, remove the useless static library:"
msgstr ""
"Ainda como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, remova a biblioteca estática inútil:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm /usr/lib/libfdt.a</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm /usr/lib/libfdt.a</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='texlive'/> installed, you can build the PDF "
"format of the documentation by issuing the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='texlive'/> instalado, poderá construir o "
"formato PDF da documentação emitindo o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd ../Documentation\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper &amp;&amp;\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper -c\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd ../Documentation\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper &amp;&amp;\n"
"  latexmk -bibtex --pdf dtc-paper -c\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To install the documentation, as the &root; user issue the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"Para instalar a documentação, como o(a) usuário(a) &root; emita o seguinte "
"comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -R ../Documentation -T /usr/share/doc/dtc-&dtc-"
"version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -R ../Documentation -T /usr/share/doc/dtc-&dtc-"
"version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed both <xref linkend='setuptools_scm'/> and <xref "
"linkend='swig'/> and you wish to install the Python 3 binding of this "
"package, build the Python 3 module:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado <xref linkend='setuptools_scm'/> e <xref "
"linkend='swig'/> e desejar instalar a ligação Python 3 desse pacote, "
"construa o módulo Python 3:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:135
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/use_scm_version/a \"fallback_version\": \"1.7.0\",' ../setup.py &amp;&amp;\n"
"&build-wheel-cmd; ..</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/use_scm_version/a \"fallback_version\": \"1.7.0\",' ../setup.py &amp;&amp;\n"
"&build-wheel-cmd; ..</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid "As the &root; user, install the Python 3 module:"
msgstr "Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, instale o módulo Python 3:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:142
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&install-wheel; libfdt</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>&install-wheel; libfdt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dpython=disabled</parameter>: This switch prevents building the "
"Python 3 binding with the deprecated method (running "
"<command>setup.py</command> directly).  We will build the Python 3 binding "
"with the <command>pip3 wheel</command> command separately if wanted."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dpython=disabled</parameter>: Essa chave impede construir a "
"ligação do Python 3 com o método obsoleto (executando "
"<command>setup.py</command> diretamente). Nós construiremos a ligação do "
"Python 3 com o comando <command>pip3 wheel</command> separadamente, se "
"desejado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/dtc.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed ... ../setup.py</command>: This command allows building the "
"Python 3 binding from a release tarball (instead of a Git checkout)."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed ... ../setup.py</command>: Esse comando permite construir a "
"ligação do Python 3 a partir de um tarball de lançamento (em vez de um "
"checkout do Git)."

